      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW JASTA (6) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by half a length at Ballarat in a handy 25.55 beating Star Rebel. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. SCOTT CHARISMA (1) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at this track over 450m behind Slick Rocket (26.00) in a Mix 3/4. Form is hard to fault from this box, with a win and six minor placings from seven starts. Cannot be underestimated. SPANISH ARMADA (2) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at Healesville over 350m behind Rattlin' Bones (19.92) in a Grade 5. Was a winner the start prior. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. NICMAC ACE (3) will need to run right up to last start to feature again.",
